摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"This is a standalone terminal for deepseek-harness (designed based on a plug-in approach), updated in sync with the official deepseek-harness repository, and inherits the capabilities of the official product.","id":"gh:1341558300","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"deepseek-harness-tui","slug":"papachong/deepseek-harness-tui","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"This is a standalone terminal for deepseek-harness (designed based on a plug-in approach), updated i"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"n sync with the official deepseek-harness repository, and inherits the capabilities of the official "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ith the official deepseek-harness repository, and inherits the capabilities of the official product."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH TUI"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A terminal UI for DeepSeek Harness, the plugin-based agent harness where everything is a plugin. DSH"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" TUI runs the agent loop in-process and renders it with an OpenTUI (SolidJS) interface: streaming ma"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rkdown, per-tool cards, themes, and work modes."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Features:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Home and chat pages with streaming markdown replies\n- Tool-call cards: terminal, diff, read, searc"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"h, web\n- Slash commands with an autocomplete menu: `/model`, `/mode`, `/theme`, `/lang`, `/sessions`"},{"id":"p6s3","text":", `/clear`, `/compact`, `/goal`, `/plan`\n- `@path` file mentions and `@[session]` cross-session ment"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ions\n- Sidebar session list with resume, approval prompts, 33 themes\n- Tab-cyclable work modes (stan"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"dard / code / minimal / cordis) backed by agent presets\n- Runtime UI locale switching (`en` / `zh`),"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" detected from the system env and overridable via `/lang`\n- JSONL session persistence under `./.sess"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ions` (override with `DSH_SESSION_ROOT`)"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"DSH TUI is a dsh bundle distributed through the npm ecosystem (no standalone binary). The package is"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" published as `@ruhooai/dsh-tui` with a prebuilt `lib/`."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Via dsh (recommended)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Install the bundle into a profile, then launch through the profile:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Add `dsh-tui` to the profile's `dsh.profile.bundles` (the `add` command appends it), then run the pr"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ofile's bin. Set `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` for live model turns; see the dsh publish guide for the bundle/`"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"package.json` `\"dsh\"` metadata."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Via npm directly"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Requires `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` peer packages to be resolvable (the dsh profile install path satisfies"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" this; a bare `bunx` needs the peers present in the surrounding `node_modules`)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### From source (for development)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Requires Node.js ^22.19 or >=24 (build tooling) and Bun 1.3+ (compiles the Solid view and runs the r"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"esult — the OpenTUI renderer draws through `bun:ffi`, which Node.js does not provide)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"To hack on the interface, the view layer lives in `packages/bundle/tui/src/view/` (SolidJS component"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"s, store, themes) and the REPL runner in `src/runner.ts`. Rebuild the view with `pnpm --filter @ruho"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"oai/dsh-tui run build:view` and relaunch `bun lib/bin.js`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"To compose your own agent instead of editing the UI, write your own `cordis.yml` — mount different p"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"lugins, presets, or models — and point the bin at it. The TUI renders whatever the composition produ"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ns, presets, or models — and point the bin at it. The TUI renders whatever the composition produces."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The bin takes the composition config from the first non-empty channel: `$DSH_CORDIS_CONFIG`, then th"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"e positional argument. Useful flags and variables:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- `--resume <sessionId>` — rebuild the agent on a persisted session\n- `DSH_SESSION_ROOT` — session s"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"torage root (default `./.sessions`)\n- `DSH_CWD` — working directory for bash and filesystem tools"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Planned"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Single-file binary**: a download-and-run executable per platform (Windows/macOS/Linux) is explor"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ed as a future channel via `bun build --compile`, but the npm bundle path above is the official dist"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"uture channel via `bun build --compile`, but the npm bundle path above is the official distribution."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Issues and pull requests are welcome at github.com/papachong/deepseek-harness-tui. Before pushing, r"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"un the relevant checks (`pnpm run typecheck`, `pnpm run lint`, focused `pnpm run test`); see AGENTS."},{"id":"p26s3","text":"md for repository conventions."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
